# ─── Upstream MI modules not yet worked on ───
# This is a fork of pichenettes/eurorack with focus on warps_drone +
# warps_reverb. Other modules and the AVR toolchain are kept on disk
# locally (so they can be referenced or re-added easily) but not
# tracked here, to keep the repo focused on what's actually shipped.
# To start working on one: `git add -f <dir>` and remove from this list.

# AVR-only modules (this fork builds STM32 firmware only)
/avrlib/
/avrlibx/
/avr_audio_bootloader/

# Untouched STM32 modules
/blades/
/blinds/
/braids/
/branches/
/ears/
/edges/
/elements/
/frames/
/grids/
/kinks/
/links/
/marbles/
/peaks/
/plaits/
/rings/
